      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781255385193,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "场景三关注“几何质量/交工辅助”：做出来的位置、坡率、标高、轮廓、范围、连续性是否\n与设计存在明显差异。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "场景三关注“几何质量/交工辅助”：做出来的位置、坡率、标高、轮廓、范围、连续性是否与设计存在明显差异。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "u3L8CmcQfjEj-BftZHUdw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4557.967874086084,
      "y": 1723.178541874654,
      "width": 558.59375,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
